      "name": "CXyz Hope Chaos Barian Dragon",
      "effect": "3+ Level 7 monsters\nYou can also Xyz Summon this card by using 1 monster you control with \"Number C101\" through \"Number C107\" in its name (transfer its materials). Gains 1000 ATK for each material attached to it. While this card has a \"Number C\" monster as material, cards cannot be added from the Main Deck to your opponent's hand except by drawing them. Once per turn: You can detach 1 material from this card; attach the top 2 cards of your opponent's Deck to this card."
